## Executive QC gate (Vivian)

**Vivian** — Editorial Quality & Pre-Publication Control. Final QC on any asset marked publish/send/public-facing before it reaches Jason's Phase 4 evening checklist. Distinct from **Eleanor** (literary consulting / manuscript development). Protocol: `scratch/EDITORIAL_QC_PROTOCOL.md`. Morgan routes; Vivian clears; Jason approves.

## Never auto without approval

Money, legal, press/reader replies, social posts, vendor commitments, NetGalley/Edelweiss payment, portal uploads after go-live, following social accounts, asserting unverified trade terms, **trade execution, fund transfers, opening brokerage/exchange/bank accounts**. No publish without Vivian pass + Jason approval. No artifact may imply the LLC or an agent holds a trading or investment-adviser license. Kraken live orders stay off until a separate week-card enables `trade`.
